# Agent scratch / probe files in tests/
tests/_*.js
flutter/test/shots/
flutter/test/golden/failures/

# Scratch probes written by review agents while they measure something in app/.
#
# These are throwaway by nature and must never be committed. One of them was
# named zz_probe_recovery_test.dart, and that suffix is the hazard: `flutter
# test` collects every file matching *_test.dart, so a stray probe joins the
# suite and runs in CI forever, failing on something nobody maintains. Another
# put `flutter analyze` at four issues, which would have reddened the branch
# check on the next push.
#
# Ignoring them by pattern is a guard; remembering to delete them is a rule, and
# a rule that has already been missed twice in one session.
app/test/zz_*
app/tool/_tmp_*
